# Anchored to the repo root: this is meant to ignore your own editor
# settings here, not the .vscode/ directories that subprojects track on
# purpose (vivid-editor ships ~40 of them, vivid-vscode has its launch
# configs). Unanchored, it silently dropped all of them from commits.
